N:The closing strain carried a captured tempo curve as inline [Q:] fields.
N:abcjs does not read an inline Q:, and reported each one as an unknown bar
N:type -- the last four bars came out barred in halves. The curve is gone and
N:the written "molto rit." and "in Tempo" carry the indication instead.
N:The last bar ends "d2 d/ z/", the same bar the tune repeats from, minus the
N:a/>g/ pickup -- so the pickup completes it and the tune comes round on the beat.
